      "title": "None return breaks checkout and receipt callers",
      "description": "tax_for now returns None for an unknown region. order_total adds the result to an int, and tax_line divides it by 100, and neither checks for None. Checkout raises TypeError for every order from an unknown region. Receipt printing raises the same error, where before both charged zero tax. Keep returning 0 for unknown regions. If None is intended, update order_total and tax_line in the same change to handle it.",
